# Per-stage build/runtime config sourced by Makefile.env and Makefile.k8s.
#
# Secrets convention: any *_PEM_KEY / *_KEY / *_DSN_KEY / GIT_SSH_KEY value
# below is a TEAMVAULT LOOKUP KEY (~6-12 alphanumeric chars, e.g. "kLoejw"),
# NOT a raw secret. The real secret material lives in teamvault; the
# `teamvaultFileBase64` / `teamvaultPassword` / `teamvaultConfig` template
# functions in k8s/*-secret.yaml resolve these keys at `kubectl apply` time.
# Do NOT replace the short values with literal PEM / passwords / DSNs.
# Convention reference: ~/Documents/workspaces/coding/docs/teamvault-conventions.md

